import{_ as t,o as i,c as o,a2 as s}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 851 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy · Overview — The Transcended One's Philosophical System","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 851 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy · Overview — The Transcended One's Philosophical System","no":851,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Philosophy","Worldview","Axiom System","Ultimate Argument"],"related":["01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto","02-Anchor Origin Definition and Essence","04-Anti-Predationism Core Thesis","855-Philosophical Depth of the Law-First Axiom"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0851_模块4-超脱者与哲学-总论.md","filePath":"en/0851_模块4-超脱者与哲学-总论.md"}`),n={name:"en/0851_模块4-超脱者与哲学-总论.md"};function a(r,e,l,h,d,p){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[s('<h1 id="entry-851-transcended-ones-and-philosophy-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-philosophical-system" tabindex="-1">Entry 851 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Philosophical System <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-851-transcended-ones-and-philosophy-·-overview-—-the-transcended-one-s-philosophical-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 851 | Transcended Ones and Philosophy · Overview — The Transcended One&#39;s Philosophical System&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 01, 02, 04, 855</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-strongest-must-answer-why-live-otherwise-his-strength-has-no-meaning" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the strongest must answer &quot;why live,&quot; otherwise his strength has no meaning <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-strongest-must-answer-why-live-otherwise-his-strength-has-no-meaning" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the strongest must answer &quot;why live,&quot; otherwise his strength has no meaning&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old worldview&#39;s strong ones never talk philosophy. He only needs to answer &quot;how to become stronger,&quot; never answers &quot;for what after becoming strong.&quot; So the stronger he is, the emptier he becomes — Ye Fan&#39;s loneliness as a Mortal-World Immortal, Shi Hao&#39;s solitude after sole decision over eons, Gu Chensha&#39;s nothingness after bearing all beings&#39; sins; the root is all here: <strong>he has no philosophy that can settle himself.</strong> Heng Yuan Zhou requires the transcended one not only know how to build, but have a self-consistent philosophy, answering &quot;why this cosmos is this way, why power is used this way, why Myriad Ranks walk this way.&quot; This entry is the &quot;Transcended Ones and Philosophy&quot; sub-theme overview, explaining what the transcended one&#39;s philosophical system looks like as a whole, and what is the fundamental difference from the old world&#39;s &quot;the strong are invincible&quot; nihilistic philosophy.</p><p>Six top-level axioms here are themselves philosophy&#39;s cornerstone — they are not rules imposed by power, but demonstrated cosmic axioms: <strong>the anti-predation axiom, the republican axiom of Myriad Races, the collective ascension axiom, the causal self-discipline axiom, and the law-first axiom</strong>; these six are the transcended one&#39;s philosophical system&#39;s foundation. Subsequent entries expand respectively: symbiosis philosophy (852), anti-predation philosophy&#39;s ultimate demonstration (853), Myriad-Rank-republican philosophy&#39;s foundation (854), law-first axiom&#39;s philosophical depth (855).</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-the-strongest-most-needs-philosophy" tabindex="-1">I. Why the Strongest Most Needs Philosophy <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-the-strongest-most-needs-philosophy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why the Strongest Most Needs Philosophy&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The greater the power, the deeper the meaning crisis. An ordinary person living has firewood, rice, oil, salt, family and friendship; a transcended one once strong enough to create cosmoses, daily meaning all fails — why does he still get up early? Why still build? Why not just lie flat or destroy everything?</p><p>The old world&#39;s answer is &quot;invincibility is most lonely,&quot; then slides into hang-up retirement (entry 729 critique series). Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer is: <strong>give the transcended one a philosophy that can settle eternity.</strong> When he understands he is one link on the Myriad-Rank symbiotic chain, his power has axiomatic basis, his construction points to cosmic uplift, he will not lose himself in eternity. Philosophy is the transcended one&#39;s &quot;spiritual preservative&quot; against madness, emptiness, and degeneration.</p><h2 id="ii-the-philosophical-system-s-four-pillars" tabindex="-1">II. The Philosophical System&#39;s Four Pillars <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-philosophical-system-s-four-pillars" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Philosophical System&#39;s Four Pillars&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s philosophical system is built on four pillars:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Pillar</th><th>Question Answered</th><th>Core Proposition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Ontology</td><td>What is the cosmos</td><td>Wanling Hengmao Origin Cosmos; Myriad-Rank origin bidirectional circulation (Document 02)</td></tr><tr><td>Axiology</td><td>What is worth pursuing</td><td>Anti-predation, Myriad-Rank republicanism, collective uplift</td></tr><tr><td>Methodology</td><td>What to do</td><td>Law-first, causal self-discipline, Alaya supervision</td></tr><tr><td>Teleology</td><td>Where to go</td><td>Lift Myriad Ranks together toward the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm in perpetual uplift</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Four pillars together answer all the transcended one&#39;s questions from &quot;who am I&quot; to &quot;where am I going.&quot; It is not empty talk; each corresponds to an operable institution (charter, assessment, supervision).</p><h2 id="iii-philosophy-is-not-dogma-but-a-demonstrated-system" tabindex="-1">III. Philosophy Is Not Dogma, but a Demonstrated System <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-philosophy-is-not-dogma-but-a-demonstrated-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Philosophy Is Not Dogma, but a Demonstrated System&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s philosophy has a fundamental difference from the old world&#39;s &quot;whoever is strong decides&quot; dogma:</p><ul><li><strong>Demonstrable</strong>: every axiom has complete demonstration (e.g., entry 853 specially treats anti-predation), not &quot;I say so and it is so&quot;;</li><li><strong>Correctable</strong>: operating-level philosophical propositions may be revised through Myriad-Rank democratic procedure (entry 814); fundamental axioms are immovable;</li><li><strong>Practical</strong>: philosophy does not stop in the study; it directly becomes education, technology, art, and institutional design;</li><li><strong>Self-consistent</strong>: the five axioms do not conflict with each other, forming a logical closed loop (the law-first axiom guarantees this).</li></ul><p>This is precisely the law-first axiom&#39;s fulfillment at the philosophical layer: <strong>setting self-consistency above all.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-philosophy-and-myriad-ranks-not-the-strong-ones-private-enjoyment" tabindex="-1">IV. Philosophy and Myriad Ranks: Not the Strong Ones&#39; Private Enjoyment <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-philosophy-and-myriad-ranks-not-the-strong-ones-private-enjoyment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Philosophy and Myriad Ranks: Not the Strong Ones&#39; Private Enjoyment&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Philosophy is often seen as a few wise men&#39;s private enjoyment. Heng Yuan Zhou opposes:</p><ul><li>The transcended one&#39;s philosophy must be understandable by Myriad Ranks — it is popularized through education (entry 838) and epics (entry 848);</li><li>Philosophy&#39;s verification right belongs to Myriad Ranks — if a philosophy lets Myriad Ranks live better, it is right; if it makes Myriad Ranks suffer, it is wrong;</li><li>The transcended one is philosophy&#39;s &quot;builder,&quot; not &quot;monopolizer&quot; — philosophy is public, discussable, criticizable.</li></ul><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: a self-consistent philosophy lets the transcended one not lose direction in eternity, avoiding the enormous spiritual waste of &quot;stronger yet emptier&quot;</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: philosophy from the root demonstrates why predation does not hold (see 853), cutting predation&#39;s theoretical defense</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style strong ones have no philosophy, stronger yet emptier; Heng Yuan Zhou uses four pillars to settle the transcended one&#39;s eternity</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: philosophy faces Myriad Ranks for popularization, verification right belongs to Myriad Ranks, not exclusive to wise men</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the philosophical system&#39;s demonstration, text, and revisions all public, infinitely discussable and iterable</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-philosophy-s-public-test-and-weight" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Philosophy&#39;s Public Test and Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-philosophy-s-public-test-and-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Philosophy&#39;s Public Test and Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s philosophy is not private enjoyment in a study; it must withstand Myriad Ranks&#39; public test. If a philosophy lets Myriad Ranks live better and lets the transcended one not lose direction in eternity, it is affirmed; if it is obscure, detached from Myriad Ranks, or secretly defends predation, it is criticized and revised. Philosophy construction&#39;s effect — Myriad Ranks&#39; degree of understanding, support for anti-predation, self-consistency with fundamental laws — converts into the transcended one&#39;s civilizational weight. Philosophy&#39;s demonstration process is also public under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, preventing it from becoming the strong ones&#39; excuse for monopolizing truth. Precisely because philosophy is testable, iterable, and serves Myriad Ranks, the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm will not, over endless years, sink into &quot;stronger yet emptier&quot; nihilism.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The strongest must answer &quot;why live,&quot; otherwise his strength has no meaning. The transcended one&#39;s philosophical system uses ontology, axiology, methodology, teleology four pillars to weld the Wanling Hengmao Origin Cosmos worldview, anti-predation values, law-first methodology, and common-uplift teleology into a self-consistent closed loop. It does not let the transcended one lose himself in eternity, nor let Myriad Ranks feel blank under institutions. This is the spiritual watershed where &quot;true transcendence&quot; differs from &quot;hang-up retirement&quot; — <strong>he is strong, and he knows why he is strong.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">Entry 01 · Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/02-锚点本源定义与本质.html">Entry 02 · Anchor Origin Definition and Essence</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predationism Core Thesis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/855_模块4-超脱者与哲学-法则优先公理哲学深度.html">Entry 855 · Philosophical Depth of the Law-First Axiom</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const y=t(n,[["render",a]]);export{u as __pageData,y as default};
